 end="00:46.220">So won't you pick up?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.220" end="00:47.840">Then we can link up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.840" end="00:49.740">It's not a hookup</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.740" end="00:52.910">Don't think about it too much, too much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.910" end="00:54.950">You just need to pick up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.950" end="00:56.680">Then we can link up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.680" end="00:59.630">Don't think about it too much, too much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.630" end="01:03.260">Don't think about it too much, too much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.260" end="01:06.450">Don't think about it too much, too much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.450" end="01:10.090">Too much, too much, too much, too much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.090" end="01:13.920">Much, much, much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.920" end="01:17.360">Do you think about the days when we sat down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.360" end="01:21.270">Smoking, wine and drinking haze? Or</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.270" end="01:24.750">Was it the other way?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.750" end="01:27.460">Was it the other way?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.460" end="01:29.800">Swing 'round, come and chill with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.800" end="01:33.470">I got your favorite show recorded on my TV</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.470" end="01:38.230">But we don't have to watch that, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.230" end="01:40.100">I'll turn off the radio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.100" end="01:41.770">So won't you pick up?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.770" end="01:43.450">Then we can link up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.450" end="01:45.320">It's not a hookup</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.320" end="01:48.700">Don't think about it too much, too much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.700" end="01:50.450">You just need to pick up</p><p t